    True, "label" -> "E C Grav Symbol", "language" -> "en", "paclet" -> 
    "ECGrav", "status" -> "None", "summary" -> 
    "KpathConnectedComponents[facetsLst_List, k_Integer] Given a complex as a \
list of facets facetsLst and dimensionality k, it computes the number of \
components connected by (k+1)-paths where those k-faces that form a component \
connected by a path of (k+1)-dimensional faces will form a component. It uses \
the built in Mathematica KVertexConnectedComponents function on a graph \
constructed such that the vertices are all k-faces and edges between them are \
1 if two faces are contained in a bigger clique and 0 otherwise. \
KpathConnectedComponents[g_Graph, k_Integer] Given a complex as a graph g and \
dimensionality k, it computes the number of components connected by \
(k+1)-paths where those k-faces that form a component connected by a path of \
(k+1)-dimensional faces will form a component. It uses the built in \
Mathematica KVertexConnectedComponents function on a graph constructed such \
that the vertices are all k-faces and edges between them are 1 if two faces \
are contained in a bigger clique and 0 otherwise.", "synonyms" -> {}, 
    "tabletags" -> {}, "title" -> "KpathConnectedComponents", "titlemodifier" -> 
    "", "metadescription" -> "", "windowtitle" -> "KpathConnectedComponents", 
